, Professional)\n\nHuman Anatomy delivers the most immersive and intuitive human anatomical experience available on market designed for students, medical and nursing schools, universities, healthcare systems, medical associations, and health practitioners. Feature rich content is delivered in a deeply engaging experience with excellent graphics, innovative presentation, and visual delivery.\n\nThe software provides 15 human body systems with more than 10 000 realistic anatomical structures designed by medical professionals. Bone mapping with 5000 bony features organized into Parts, Surfaces, Borders, and Landmarks. 21 Microanatomy models, over 500 movements animations and more!", "short_description": "The most advanced anatomical platform for virtual reality is finally here on Oculus Quest! \n\nNew Update! \nHANDTRACKING in now supported as experimental feature.\n\nVirtual Medicine has created the most advanced, multi-award-winning medical anatomy platform crossing Virtual Reality (VR), Mixed Reality (MR), and Augmented Reality (AR) for medical education. Human Anatomy VR is the only product on the market to provide an full VR anatomical atlas combined with advanced 3D VR DICOM viewer."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.medicinevirtual.com/data/Licence_VM.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Medicine s.r.o", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://medicinevirtual.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": ["MEDICINE", "EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE", "STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "1069716047089480"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "964317198499449"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "551650669784639"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "964317198499449"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1737973080, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "964317198499449"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26570772162620774", "version": "2026.36.2"}, "id": "922013611804643", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3662196457238336", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26570772162620774"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789151283, "id": "26602937866070870", "version": "2026.36.3.1", "version_code": 736, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26602928339405156"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3662196457238336", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26570772162620774"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789024224, "id": "26582017681496222", "version": "2026.36.3.100", "version_code": 735, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26582010158163641"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3662196457238336", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26570772162620774"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "922013611804643"}]}, "change_log": "Our biggest update yet \u2014 five brand-new modules.\n\n\u2022 AI TUTOR (new) \u2014 Ask out loud and a 3D tutor answers by voice. It tells you\n  more about the structure you're pointing at and adapts the explanation to your\n  level, from first year to practising clinician. It can also run the app for\n  you: enable a system, scale the body, hide specific structures.\n\n\u2022 GUIDED LECTURES (new) \u2014 Step-by-step lessons that drive the model for you,\n  narrated in the lecture's own language. Go at your own pace, and ask the AI\n  tutor anything mid-lecture.\n\n\u2022 SPORTS INJURY ANIMATIONS (new) \u2014 12 injury animations that highlight the\n  affected tissue as the movement happens.\n\n\u2022 ANATOMY DIAGRAM (new) \u2014 A tree view of the whole body, from systems down to\n  individual structures. Click an entry to highlight and enable it instantly.\n\n\u2022 ASSESSMENTS, UNIFIED \u2014 Quizzes, tests and practice in one place, plus a new\n  task type: identify the structure directly on the 3D model. Teachers assign\n  tests from the web portal, watch a live class overview, and get results saved\n  automatically.\n\n\u2022 REBUILT VR KEYBOARD \u2014 Clearer layout, full symbol set, hold-to-delete\n  backspace, and Enter picks the first search result.\n\n\u2022 VIETNAMESE ADDED \u2014 17 languages in total, with quality improvements across\n  all of them.\n\n\u2022 PRIVACY CONTROLS \u2014 Opt out of analytics entirely, read the terms and privacy\n  policy in-app, and sign in through a more secure system.\n\n\u2022 PATCH \u2014 Fixes a rare sign-out issue on institutional licences.\n\nPlus hundreds of UI refinements and fixes.\n\nFeature availability depends on your licence type.", "created_date": 1788955120, "id": "26570772162620774", "version": "2026.36.2", "version_code": 734, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26570765029288154"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3662196457238336", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26570772162620774"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788944832, "id": "26569147946116529", "version": "2026.36.2", "version_code": 733, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26569142122783778"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "3662196457238336", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26570772162620774"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1788810383, "id": "26550644671300190", "version": "2026.36.1.101", "version_code": 732, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26550638551300802"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBi